"How many tools the model may invoke in a single round (one model reply). "
"Distinct from max tool rounds, which limits how many times the model is "
"called."
msgstr "模型一次回复里最多执行几个工具。与「最大工具轮次」不同：轮次限制的是向模型请求几趟，本项限制的是同一趟里并列调用几次。"

